{{!
    @template tool_vae/withdraw_page

    The page "Retirer une attestation", below its heading: the declaration, the attestation withdrawn, the form.

    The template holds no logic. Three keys are HTML (triple braces): declarationhtml, drawn by the template
    tool_vae/attest_declaration; attestationshtml, drawn by the template tool_vae/attestations; formhtml, the form of the
    core ($form->render()).

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * declarationhtml - HTML, the declaration and the warning of its anchor
    * attestationshtml - HTML, the attestation withdrawn
    * formhtml - HTML, the form

    Example context (json):
    {
        "declarationhtml": "<dl class=\"tool-vae-claim\"><dt>Record</dt><dd>RS5000-C01</dd></dl>",
        "attestationshtml": "<ul class=\"tool-vae-attestations\"><li><strong>Director</strong></li></ul>",
        "formhtml": "<form action=\"#\"></form>"
    }
}}
{{{declarationhtml}}}
{{{attestationshtml}}}
{{{formhtml}}}
